#: src/berry.c:114
msgid "The Berry's thick skin and fruit are"
msgstr "这种树果的厚皮和果肉"

#: src/berry.c:115
msgid "very tough. It is dry-tasting all over."
msgstr "都非常坚硬，整体味道很涩。"

#: src/berry.c:141
msgid "Pecha"
