#: src/berry.c:240
msgid "Leppa"
msgstr "苹野"

#: src/berry.c:246
msgid "Grows slower than Cheri and others."
msgstr "比樱子果等长得慢。"

#: src/berry.c:247
msgid "The smaller the Berry, the tastier."
msgstr "树果越小，味道越好。"

#: src/berry.c:273
msgid "Oran"
msgstr "橙橙"

#: src/berry.c:279
msgid "A peculiar Berry with a mix of flavors."
msgstr "混合了多种味道的奇特树果。"

#: src/berry.c:280
msgid "Berries grow in half a day."
msgstr "半天就能结出树果。"

#: src/berry.c:306
msgid "Persim"
msgstr "柿仔"

#: src/berry.c:312
msgid "Loves sunlight. The Berry's color"
msgstr "喜欢阳光。照到阳光时，"

#: src/berry.c:313
msgid "grows vivid when exposed to the sun."
msgstr "树果的颜色会变得鲜艳。"

#: src/berry.c:339
msgid "Lum"
msgstr "木子"

#: src/berry.c:345
msgid "Slow to grow. If raised with loving"
msgstr "生长缓慢。如果用心栽培，"

#: src/berry.c:346
msgid "care, it may grow two Berries."
msgstr "也许能结出两个树果。"

#: src/berry.c:372
msgid "Sitrus"
msgstr "文柚"

#: src/berry.c:378
msgid "Closely related to Oran. The large"
msgstr "与橙橙果是近亲。大颗的"

#: src/berry.c:379
msgid "Berry has a well-rounded flavor."
msgstr "树果味道十分均衡。"

#: src/berry.c:405
msgid "Figy"
msgstr "勿花"

#: src/berry.c:411
msgid "The Berry, which looks chewed up,"
msgstr "这种树果看起来像被嚼过，"

#: src/berry.c:412
msgid "brims with spicy substances."
msgstr "里面满是辣味成分。"

#: src/berry.c:438
msgid "Wiki"
msgstr "异奇"

#: src/berry.c:444
msgid "The Berry is said to have grown lumpy"
msgstr "据说树果长得凹凸不平，"

#: src/berry.c:445
msgid "to help Pokémon grip it."
msgstr "是为了让宝可梦方便抓握。"

#: src/berry.c:471
msgid "Mago"
msgstr "芒芒"

#: src/berry.c:477
msgid "The Berry turns curvy as it grows."
msgstr "树果会越长越弯。"

#: src/berry.c:478
msgid "The curvier, the sweeter and tastier."
msgstr "越弯就越甜、越好吃。"

#: src/berry.c:504
msgid "Aguav"
msgstr "乐芭"

#: src/berry.c:510
msgid "The flower is dainty. It is rare in its"
msgstr "花朵小巧精致。少见的是，"

#: src/berry.c:511
msgid "ability to grow without light."
msgstr "它在没有光的地方也能生长。"

#: src/berry.c:537
msgid "Iapapa"
msgstr "芭亚"

#: src/berry.c:543
msgid "The Berry is very big and sour."
msgstr "树果又大又酸。"

#: src/berry.c:544
msgid "It takes at least a day to grow."
msgstr "至少需要一天才能长成。"

#: src/berry.c:570
msgid "Razz"
msgstr "蔓莓"

#: src/berry.c:576
msgid "The red Berry tastes slightly spicy."
msgstr "红色的树果，味道微辣。"

#: src/berry.c:577
msgid "It grows quickly in just four hours."
msgstr "长得很快，只需四个小时。"

#: src/berry.c:603
msgid "Bluk"
msgstr "墨莓"

#: src/berry.c:609
msgid "The Berry is blue on the outside, but"
msgstr "树果外表是蓝色的，"

#: src/berry.c:610
msgid "it blackens the mouth when eaten."
msgstr "但吃了会把嘴染黑。"

#: src/berry.c:636
msgid "Nanab"
msgstr "蕉香"

#: src/berry.c:642
msgid "This Berry was the seventh"
msgstr "世界上第七种被发现的"

#: src/berry.c:643
msgid "discovered in the world. It is sweet."
msgstr "树果。味道很甜。"

#: src/berry.c:669
msgid "Wepear"
msgstr "西梨"

#: src/berry.c:675
msgid "The flower is small and white. It has a"
msgstr "花朵小小的、白白的。"

#: src/berry.c:676
msgid "delicate balance of bitter and sour."
msgstr "苦味和酸味微妙地平衡。"

#: src/berry.c:702
msgid "Pinap"
msgstr "凰梨"

#: src/berry.c:708
msgid "Weak against wind and cold."
msgstr "不耐风吹和寒冷。"

#: src/berry.c:709
msgid "The fruit is spicy and the skin, sour."
msgstr "果肉辣，果皮酸。"

#: src/berry.c:735
msgid "Pomeg"
msgstr "榴石"

#: src/berry.c:741
msgid "However much it is watered,"
msgstr "无论浇多少水，"

#: src/berry.c:742
msgid "it only grows up to six Berries."
msgstr "最多也只能结出六个树果。"

#: src/berry.c:768
msgid "Kelpsy"
msgstr "藻根"

#: src/berry.c:774
msgid "A rare variety shaped like a root."
msgstr "形状像树根的稀有品种。"

#: src/berry.c:775
msgid "Grows a very large flower."
msgstr "会开出非常大的花朵。"

#: src/berry.c:801
msgid "Qualot"
msgstr "比巴"

#: src/berry.c:807
msgid "Loves water. Grows strong even in"
msgstr "喜欢水。即使在常年"

#: src/berry.c:808
msgid "locations with constant rainfall."
msgstr "下雨的地方也能茁壮成长。"

#: src/berry.c:834
msgid "Hondew"
msgstr "哈密"

#: src/berry.c:840
msgid "A Berry that is very valuable and"
msgstr "非常珍贵、难得一见的"

#: src/berry.c:841
msgid "rarely seen. It is very delicious."
msgstr "树果。味道非常好。"

#: src/berry.c:867
msgid "Grepa"
msgstr "萄葡"

#: src/berry.c:873
msgid "Despite its tenderness and round"
msgstr "虽然柔软又圆滚滚的，"

#: src/berry.c:874
msgid "shape, the Berry is unimaginably sour."
msgstr "树果却酸得超乎想象。"

#: src/berry.c:900
msgid "Tamato"
msgstr "茄番"

#: src/berry.c:906
msgid "The Berry is lip-bendingly spicy."
msgstr "辣得让人嘴唇都歪了。"

#: src/berry.c:907
msgid "It takes time to grow."
msgstr "需要花些时间才能长成。"

#: src/berry.c:933
msgid "Cornn"
msgstr "玉黍"

#: src/berry.c:939
msgid "A Berry from an ancient era. May not"
msgstr "来自古代的树果。如果不"

#: src/berry.c:940
msgid "grow unless planted in quantity."
msgstr "大量种植，可能不会生长。"

#: src/berry.c:966
msgid "Magost"
msgstr "岳竹"

#: src/berry.c:972
msgid "A Berry that is widely said to have"
msgstr "这种树果被普遍认为"

#: src/berry.c:973
msgid "a finely balanced flavor."
msgstr "味道非常均衡。"

#: src/berry.c:999
msgid "Rabuta"
msgstr "茸丹"

#: src/berry.c:1005
msgid "A rare variety that is overgrown with"
msgstr "长满了毛的稀有品种。"

#: src/berry.c:1006
msgid "hair. It is quite bitter."
msgstr "味道相当苦。"

#: src/berry.c:1032
msgid "Nomel"
msgstr "檬柠"

#: src/berry.c:1038
msgid "Quite sour. Just one bite makes it"
msgstr "相当酸。只要咬上一口，"

#: src/berry.c:1039
msgid "impossible to taste for three days."
msgstr "三天都尝不出味道。"

#: src/berry.c:1065
msgid "Spelon"
msgstr "刺角"

#: src/berry.c:1071
msgid "The vividly red Berry is very spicy."
msgstr "鲜红色的树果，非常辣。"

#: src/berry.c:1072
msgid "Its warts secrete a spicy substance."
msgstr "表面的疙瘩会分泌辣味成分。"

#: src/berry.c:1098
msgid "Pamtre"
msgstr "椰木"

#: src/berry.c:1104
msgid "Drifts on the sea from somewhere."
msgstr "不知从何处漂流而来。"

#: src/berry.c:1105
msgid "It is thought to grow elsewhere."
msgstr "据说生长在别的地方。"

#: src/berry.c:1131
msgid "Watmel"
msgstr "瓜西"

#: src/berry.c:1137
msgid "A huge Berry, with some over 20"
msgstr "巨大的树果，曾发现过"

#: src/berry.c:1138
msgid "inches discovered. Exceedingly sweet."
msgstr "超过50厘米的。非常甜。"

#: src/berry.c:1164
msgid "Durin"
msgstr "金枕"

#: src/berry.c:1170
msgid "Bitter to even look at. It is so"
msgstr "光是看着就觉得苦。苦到"

#: src/berry.c:1171
msgid "bitter, no one has ever eaten it as is."
msgstr "从来没有人直接吃过它。"

#: src/berry.c:1197
msgid "Belue"
msgstr "靛莓"

#: src/berry.c:1203
msgid "It is glossy and looks delicious, but"
msgstr "富有光泽，看起来很好吃，"

#: src/berry.c:1204
msgid "it is awfully sour. Takes time to grow."
msgstr "但非常酸。需要时间生长。"

#: src/berry.c:1230
msgid "Occa"
msgstr "巧可"

#: src/berry.c:1236
msgid "Said to grow in the tropics once,"
msgstr "据说曾经生长在热带，"

#: src/berry.c:1237
msgid "it boasts an intensely hot spiciness."
msgstr "有着火辣辣的强烈辣味。"

#: src/berry.c:1263
msgid "Passho"
msgstr "千香"

#: src/berry.c:1269
msgid "Its flesh is dotted with many tiny"
msgstr "果肉里有许多细小的气泡，"

#: src/berry.c:1270
msgid "bubbles that keep it afloat in water."
msgstr "所以能浮在水面上。"

#: src/berry.c:1296
msgid "Wacan"
msgstr "烛木"

#: src/berry.c:1302
msgid "Energy drawn from lightning strikes"
msgstr "吸收了雷击的能量，"

#: src/berry.c:1303
msgid "makes this Berry grow big and rich."
msgstr "这种树果长得又大又饱满。"

#: src/berry.c:1329
msgid "Rindo"
msgstr "罗子"

#: src/berry.c:1335
msgid "This berry has a vegetable-like flavor,"
msgstr "这种树果有蔬菜般的味道，"

#: src/berry.c:1336
msgid "but is rich in health-promoting fiber."
msgstr "富含有益健康的膳食纤维。"

#: src/berry.c:1362
msgid "Yache"
msgstr "番荔"

#: src/berry.c:1368
msgid "This Berry has a refreshing dry and"
msgstr "这种树果有清爽的涩味和"

#: src/berry.c:1369
msgid "sour flavor. Tastes better chilled."
msgstr "酸味。冰镇后更好吃。"

#: src/berry.c:1395
msgid "Chople"
msgstr "莲蒲"

#: src/berry.c:1401
msgid "Contains a substance that generates"
msgstr "含有能产生热量的成分，"

#: src/berry.c:1402
msgid "heat. Can even fire up a chilly heart."
msgstr "甚至能温暖冰冷的心。"

#: src/berry.c:1428
msgid "Kebia"
msgstr "通通"

#: src/berry.c:1434
msgid "Brilliant green on the outside, inside"
msgstr "外表是鲜艳的绿色，"

#: src/berry.c:1435
msgid "it is packed with black-colored flesh."
msgstr "里面却塞满了黑色的果肉。"

#: src/berry.c:1461
msgid "Shuca"
msgstr "腰木"

#: src/berry.c:1467
msgid "The sweet pulp has just the hint of a"
msgstr "甜美的果肉中，带有一丝"

#: src/berry.c:1468
msgid "a hard-edged and fragrant bite to it."
msgstr "强烈而芬芳的口感。"

#: src/berry.c:1494
msgid "Coba"
msgstr "棱瓜"

#: src/berry.c:1500
msgid "This Berry is said to be a cross of"
msgstr "据说这种树果是从远方飘来的"

#: src/berry.c:1501
msgid "two Berries blown in from far away."
msgstr "两种树果杂交而成的。"

#: src/berry.c:1527
msgid "Payapa"
msgstr "福禄"

#: src/berry.c:1533
msgid "Said to sense human emotions, it swells"
msgstr "据说能感知人的情绪，"

#: src/berry.c:1534
msgid "roundly when a person approaches."
msgstr "有人靠近时会胀得圆圆的。"

#: src/berry.c:1560
msgid "Tanga"
msgstr "扁樱"

#: src/berry.c:1566
msgid "It grows a flower at the tip that lures"
msgstr "尖端开出的花用丝状花瓣"

#: src/berry.c:1567
msgid "Bug Pokémon with its stringy petals."
msgstr "吸引虫属性宝可梦。"

#: src/berry.c:1593
msgid "Charti"
msgstr "草蚕"

#: src/berry.c:1599
msgid "Often used for pickles because of its"
msgstr "因为味道涩，常用来腌渍。"

#: src/berry.c:1600
msgid "dry flavor. Sometimes eaten raw."
msgstr "有时也会生吃。"

#: src/berry.c:1626
msgid "Kasib"
msgstr "佛柑"

#: src/berry.c:1632
msgid "Old superstitions say it has an odd"
msgstr "古老的迷信说它有奇特的"

#: src/berry.c:1633
msgid "power. A popular good-luck charm."
msgstr "力量，是很受欢迎的护身符。"

#: src/berry.c:1659
msgid "Haban"
msgstr "莓榴"

#: src/berry.c:1665
msgid "Less bitter if enough of this Berry"
msgstr "熬煮足够的量就不那么苦了。"

#: src/berry.c:1666
msgid "is boiled down. Makes a good jam."
msgstr "可以做成好吃的果酱。"

#: src/berry.c:1692
msgid "Colbur"
msgstr "刺耳"

#: src/berry.c:1698
msgid "Tiny hooks on the surface latch onto"
msgstr "表面的小钩子会挂在宝可梦"

#: src/berry.c:1699
msgid "Pokémon to reach far-off places."
msgstr "身上，以便被带到远方。"

#: src/berry.c:1725
msgid "Babiri"
msgstr "霹霹"

#: src/berry.c:1731
msgid "Very tough with a strong flavor. It"
msgstr "非常坚硬，味道浓烈。"

#: src/berry.c:1732
msgid "was used to make medicine in the past."
msgstr "过去曾被用来制作药物。"

#: src/berry.c:1758
msgid "Chilan"
msgstr "灯浆"

#: src/berry.c:1764
msgid "It can be made into a whistle that"
msgstr "可以做成哨子，"

#: src/berry.c:1765
msgid "produces an indescribable sound."
msgstr "吹出难以形容的声音。"

#: src/berry.c:1791
msgid "Liechi"
msgstr "枝荔"

#: src/berry.c:1797 src/berry.c:1830 src/berry.c:1863 src/berry.c:1896
msgid "A mysterious Berry. It is rumored to"
msgstr "神秘的树果。据说蕴含着"

#: src/berry.c:1798
msgid "contain the power of the sea."
msgstr "大海的力量。"

#: src/berry.c:1824
msgid "Ganlon"
msgstr "龙睛"

#: src/berry.c:1831
msgid "contain the power of the land."
msgstr "大地的力量。"

#: src/berry.c:1857
msgid "Salac"
msgstr "沙鳞"

#: src/berry.c:1864
msgid "contain the power of the sky."
msgstr "天空的力量。"

#: src/berry.c:1890
msgid "Petaya"
msgstr "龙火"

#: src/berry.c:1897
msgid "contain the power of all living things."
msgstr "所有生物的力量。"

#: src/berry.c:1923
msgid "Apicot"
msgstr "杏仔"

#: src/berry.c:1929
msgid "A very mystifying Berry. No telling"
msgstr "非常不可思议的树果。不知道"

#: src/berry.c:1930
msgid "what may happen or how it can be used."
msgstr "会发生什么，也不知道怎么用。"

#: src/berry.c:1956
msgid "Lansat"
msgstr "兰萨"

#: src/berry.c:1962
msgid "Said to be a legendary Berry."
msgstr "据说是传说中的树果。"

#: src/berry.c:1963
msgid "Holding it supposedly brings joy."
msgstr "据说带在身上会带来幸福。"

#: src/berry.c:1989
msgid "Starf"
msgstr "星桃"

#: src/berry.c:1995
msgid "So strong, it was abandoned at the"
msgstr "因为太过强大而被遗弃在"

#: src/berry.c:1996
msgid "world's edge. Considered a mirage."
msgstr "世界尽头，被视为幻影。"

#: src/berry.c:2022 src/berry.c:2286
msgid "Enigma"
msgstr "谜芝"

#: src/berry.c:2028 src/berry.c:2292
msgid "A completely enigmatic Berry."
msgstr "完全是个谜的树果。"

#: src/berry.c:2029 src/berry.c:2293
msgid "Appears to have the power of stars."
msgstr "似乎蕴含着星星的力量。"

#: src/berry.c:2055
msgid "Micle"
msgstr "奇秘"

#: src/berry.c:2061
msgid "It makes other food eaten at the"
msgstr "能让同时吃下的"

#: src/berry.c:2062
msgid "same time taste sweet."
msgstr "其他食物变甜。"

#: src/berry.c:2088
msgid "Custap"
msgstr "释陀"

#: src/berry.c:2094
msgid "The flesh underneath the Custap"
msgstr "释陀果果皮下的果肉"

#: src/berry.c:2095
msgid "Berry's skin is sweet and creamy soft."
msgstr "甜美而柔软，像奶油一样。"

#: src/berry.c:2121
msgid "Jaboca"
msgstr "嘉珍"

#: src/berry.c:2127
msgid "The drupelets that make up this berry"
msgstr "构成这种树果的小核果"

#: src/berry.c:2128
msgid "pop rythmically if handled roughly."
msgstr "被粗暴对待时会有节奏地爆开。"

#: src/berry.c:2154
msgid "Rowap"
msgstr "雾莲"

#: src/berry.c:2160
msgid "People once worked top-shaped pieces"
msgstr "以前人们会把这种树果"

#: src/berry.c:2161
msgid "of this berry free to use as toys."
msgstr "削成陀螺形状当玩具玩。"

#: src/berry.c:2187
msgid "Roseli"
msgstr "洛玫"

#: src/berry.c:2193
msgid "In nature, they grow in wide rings"
msgstr "在自然中会长成大大的圆环，"

#: src/berry.c:2194
msgid "for reasons that are still unknown."
msgstr "原因至今仍不清楚。"

#: src/berry.c:2220
msgid "Kee"
msgstr "亚开"

#: src/berry.c:2226
msgid "A berry that is incredibly spicy at"
msgstr "这种树果一开始极辣，"

#: src/berry.c:2227
msgid "first, then extremely bitter."
msgstr "然后变得极苦。"

#: src/berry.c:2253
msgid "Marnga"
msgstr "香罗"

#: src/berry.c:2259
msgid "Its outside is very bitter, but its"
msgstr "外面非常苦，但里面"

#: src/berry.c:2260
msgid "inside tastes like a sweet drink."
msgstr "尝起来像甜甜的饮料。"
